# Phase 8a — Freeform canvas MVP

**Branch:** `phase-8-canvas`  
**Depends on:** Phase 7 wiki (entity link), ColorPopover tokens, uploads

## Scope (8a only)

Ship a project Canvases module with persisted tldraw documents. Defer 8b snap assists and 8c Mermaid/ERD templates to follow-up work on the same or next branch after QA.

### Data

- `canvases(id, project_id, title, document jsonb, created_at, updated_at)`
- `document` stores tldraw **document** snapshot (not session/camera)

### API (`/api/v1/projects/:projectId/canvases`)

- `GET /` — list canvases (id, title, timestamps; omit heavy document)
- `POST /` — create `{ title?, document? }`
- `GET /:id` — full canvas including document
- `PATCH /:id` — update title and/or document
- `DELETE /:id` — confirm-gated in UI

### Wiki

- Allow wiki nodes with `entityType: canvas`
- TOC action or create flow: “New canvas page” creates canvas + wiki node (mirrors document pages)

### UI

- Replace canvases placeholder with list + editor pane (tabs or sidebar like boards/wiki)
- `tldraw` editor; darker grey canvas chrome token
- Debounced autosave of document snapshot on store changes
- `+` to create; pencil rename; confirm delete
- Mark `canvases` in `IMPLEMENTED_MODULES`

### Out of scope for 8a

- Custom ColorPopover on tldraw shapes (use tldraw palette; align tokens thematically)
- Mermaid/ERD, export PNG/SVG, advanced snap (8b/8c)

## Exit criteria

- Create/open/save a mood-board style canvas on a project
- Reload restores shapes
- Wiki can nest a canvas page in the TOC and open it
- QA checklist delivered
